{"id":"653244","name":"卷心菜紫甘蓝","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/653244/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"卷心菜","amount":"1/4颗"},{"name":"紫甘蓝","amount":"1/5颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"榨菜","amount":"1袋"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"卷心菜去蒂，洗净，切丝。","img":"images/653244/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"紫甘蓝同样处理。","img":"images/653244/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅温油，倒入蔬菜，翻炒。中途少加点水，防止干锅。","img":"images/653244/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加半匙盐和一袋榨菜，翻炒均匀至入味。","img":"images/653244/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"紫甘蓝的颜色很霸道，量要比卷心菜少一些。","img":"images/653244/step_5.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}